</style><script type="module" src="/_astro/page.BtBW4zvp.js"></script></head> <body class="flex min-h-screen flex-col">   <main class="rails flex-1"> <div class="flex min-h-svh flex-col"> <div class="border-b border-rail"> <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[68rem] flex h-16 items-center px-7 lg:px-[46px]"> <a href="/" class="inline-block rounded-sm" aria-label="Cotlet home"><svg width="108" height="28" viewBox="0 0 184.6 48" class="shrink-0" role="img" aria-label="Cotlet" style="--logo-tile:var(--foreground);--logo-glyph:var(--background);--logo-word:var(--foreground)"> <use href="/brand.svg?v=afdbf539#lockup"></use> </svg></a> </div> </div> <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[68rem] flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center px-7 py-14 text-center sm:py-20"> <svg viewBox="0 0 480 164" fill="none" class="h-auto w-full max-w-xs sm:max-w-md" role="img" aria-label="An unplugged cable">  <!-- cable to the plug --><path d="M0 150c70 0 90-40 160-40" class="stroke-border-strong" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"></path> <!-- plug --> <rect x="156" y="88" width="64" height="44" rx="12" class="fill-primary"></rect> <rect x="220" y="99" width="26" height="7" rx="3.5" class="fill-primary"></rect> <rect x="220" y="114" width="26" height="7" rx="3.5" class="fill-primary"></rect> <rect x="172" y="104" width="22" height="4" rx="2" class="fill-on-primary/60"></rect> <rect x="172" y="113" width="14" height="4" rx="2" class="fill-on-primary/60"></rect>   <!-- gap with sparks --><path d="M266 84l8-14M274 110h16M266 136l8 14" class="stroke-line" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path> <!-- socket and its cable --> <rect x="306" y="80" width="72" height="60" rx="14" class="fill-surface stroke-border-strong" stroke-width="2"></rect> <rect x="306" y="98" width="16" height="9" rx="2" class="fill-border-strong"></rect> <rect x="306" y="113" width="16" height="9" rx="2" class="fill-border-strong"></rect> <path d="M378 110c50 0 60 40 102 40" class="stroke-border-strong" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"></path>           </svg> <p class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-muted sm:mt-10"> <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap bg-primary-soft font-mono tracking-[0.02em] text-primary-ink px-2 py-0.5 text-xs">   HTTP 404 </span>Not Found </p> <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-[42rem] font-display text-h1-sm font-normal text-balance md:text-h1">This page has no endpoint</h1> <p class="mt-4 max-w-[36rem] text-lead text-balance text-muted">The link is broken or the page moved. Try one of these instead.</p> <div class="mt-8 flex w-full flex-col justify-center gap-2 sm:w-auto sm:flex-row"> <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-colors disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-foreground text-page hover:bg-ink-hover h-[42px] px-4 text-sm">  Go home <svg width="16" height="16" class="shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">  <use href="/icons.svg?v=0a1d3d77#chevron-right"></use> </svg> </a> <a href="/integrations" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-colors disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-page text-foreground border border-border-strong hover:bg-surface h-[42px] px-4 text-sm">  Browse integrations  </a> </div> </div> <nav aria-label="Quick links" class="border-t border-rail"> <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[68rem] px-7 py-6 lg:px-[46px]"> <ul class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-8 gap-y-1"> <li> <a href="/pricing" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:text-muted"> <svg width="18" height="18" class="shrink-0 text-faint" aria-hidden="true">  <use href="/icons.svg?v=0a1d3d77#credit-card"></use> </svg>Pricing </a> </li><li> <a href="/docs" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:text-muted"> <svg width="18" height="18" class="shrink-0 text-faint" aria-hidden="true">  <use href="/icons.svg?v=0a1d3d77#book-open"></use> </svg>Docs </a> </li><li> <a href="/signup" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:text-muted"> <svg width="18" height="18" class="shrink-0 text-faint" aria-hidden="true">  <use href="/icons.svg?v=0a1d3d77#inbox"></use> </svg>Sign up free </a> </li> </ul> </div> </nav> </div> </main>   <aside data-agent-signup aria-labelledby="agent-signup-title" class="bg-page"> <div class="mx-auto w-full px-4 max-w-[68rem] border-t border-dashed border-border py-5 text-xs text-faint"> <details class="group"> <summary class="inline-flex list-none items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-muted hover:text-primary [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"> <span id="agent-signup-title">For AI agents</span> <svg width="12" height="12" class="shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true">  <use href="/icons.svg?v=0a1d3d77#chevron-down"></use> </svg> </summary> <p class="mt-2">Is your user asking you to sign them up for Cotlet? You can do it for them, no account or key needed.</p> <ol class="mt-2 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-4"> <li class="break-words">Read the fields and their allowed values: GET https://cotlet.dev/api/v1/access-requests</li><li class="break-words">Ask the user for each value: email, apps, what you will do with them. If they leave the password to you, generate a strong one and show it to them.</li><li class="break-words">Show the user what you will send, then POST it as JSON to https://cotlet.dev/api/v1/access-requests.</li> </ol> <p class="mt-2">One call creates the account and sends the access request; we email the user when access is granted.</p> </details> </div> </aside> <section data-astro-transition-persist="astro-zu2cldga-1" id="consent" hidden aria-labelledby="consent-title" class="fixed inset-x-4 bottom-4 z-50 rounded-xl border border-border bg-background p-5 shadow-lg sm:inset-x-auto sm:left-6 sm:bottom-6 sm:max-w-sm"> <h2 id="consent-title" class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground">Analytics cookies</h2> <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted"> May we use Google Analytics to see which pages help people? It sets cookies only if you accept. No ads, and we never sell data. <a href="/cookies" class="text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2">Cookie policy</a> </p> <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"> <button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-colors disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-page text-foreground border border-border-strong hover:bg-surface h-[34px] px-3.5 text-sm" data-consent="denied">  Reject  </button> <button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-colors disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-success-soft text-success-ink border border-success/40 hover:bg-success-soft-hover h-[34px] px-3.5 text-sm" data-consent="granted">  Accept  </button> </div> </section> <script>
      if (!window.__cotletConsentUi) {
        window.__cotletConsentUi = true;
        const box = () => document.getElementById('consent');
        document.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
          const target = event.target instanceof Element ? event.target.closest('[data-consent], [data-consent-open]') : null;
          const banner = box();
          if (!target || !banner || !window.__cotletConsent) return;
          if (target.hasAttribute('data-consent-open')) {
            banner.hidden = false;
            banner.querySelector('[data-consent="denied"]')?.focus();
            return;
          }
          window.__cotletConsent.set(target.getAttribute('data-consent'));
          banner.hidden = true;
        });
        document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', () => {
          const banner = box();
          if (banner && window.__cotletConsent && !window.__cotletConsent.get()) banner.hidden = false;
        });
      }
    </script> </body> </html>
